      "body": "## Motivation\n\nDiffusion servers starting together on one host can pick the same scheduler port: it is guessed as `5555 + randint(0, 100)` and checked by a probe that releases it. The loser's scheduler then binds `port + 42`, but its HTTP side still connects to the guessed port, so its requests are served by the other server's scheduler and GPU.\n\nWe hit this as an intermittent RL CI failure, caught by the UUID check from #32685:\n\n```\nno payload was exported from this worker's GPU 47b7c7e8-..., got ['05a0fd7c-...']\n```\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Each scheduler reports the port it actually bound in its ready message (`dp_replica`, `actual_scheduler_port`); the launcher records it in `server_args.scheduler_ports` before any client connects. A scheduler that moved off a taken port is now reached on its new port.\n- The scheduler also records the bound port in its own `server_args`, so the metrics `replica` label matches the real endpoint.\n- `--strict-ports` now fills `scheduler_ports` as well, so the list is always set.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot applicable.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37186702005](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37186702005)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37186701834](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37186701834)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37186701981](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37186701981)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
      "changedFiles": 4,
